                  "step": "Mix ingredients except Na2S x 9H2O and adjust pH to 7.0 with 1 N NaOH. Distribute the medium into culture vessels under a N2 gas atmosphere, add Na2S x 9H2O (as a 5% solution), seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
